{
  "_hints": "All shots as admin@vitalnex.demo; nothing creates data. The governance page scrolls inside <main>; each mark scrolls itself into view, so keep marks of one shot close together. gov-activity switches the period to 365 days (view-only) so the chart has data; if the chart is still empty, the 'No screenings in this period.' text appears instead of the chart and the 'Show as table' summary is missing - then mark that text as 2 and drop mark 3 (tell the writer). gov-audit uses a tall viewport so the filters, header and pager fit in one picture; if the pager is still off-screen, re-run with a larger height. The fairness section is long; marks 1-4 all target the first condition's first table (Sex). docs-page / docs-search need width >= 1280 for 'On this page' to show.",
  "out_dir": "apps/web/public/docs/admin-console",
  "shots": [
    {
      "name": "admin-dashboard",
      "account": "admin@vitalnex.demo",
      "path": "/admin/dashboard",
      "steps": [
        {
          "wait_for": "text=Clinician agree rate"
        },
        {
          "wait": 1500
        }
      ],
      "marks": [
        {
          "selector": "main div.grid > div:has-text('Models loaded')",
          "n": 1
        },
        {
          "selector": "main div.grid > div:has-text('Screenings counted')",
          "n": 2
        },
        {
          "selector": "main div.grid > div:has-text('Pending clinician reviews')",
          "n": 3
        },
        {
          "selector": "main div.grid > div:has-text('Clinician agree rate')",
          "n": 4
        },
        {
          "selector": "main a[href='/admin/governance']",
          "n": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "gov-registry",
      "account": "admin@vitalnex.demo",
      "path": "/admin/governance",
      "steps": [
        {
          "wait_for": "#registry table"
        }
      ],
      "marks": [
        {
          "selector": "main nav[aria-label='On this page']",
          "n": 1
        },
        {
          "selector": "#registry thead",
          "n": 2
        },
        {
          "selector": "#registry a:has-text('Model card') >> nth=0",
          "n": 3
        },
        {
          "selector": "#registry details >> nth=0",
          "n": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "gov-fairness",
